      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T08:35:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One synchronous countTokens POST per model — ~15–25 round trips to the Gemini API per getModels().\n\nDoes the plugin layer actually cache this, or does every dropdown render pay the cost?",
      "revId": "70eddd659961ab67d23e57733eb3dc3d4d21dde2",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
